00:02:56.600 --> 00:03:00.380
The next section names what Samuel Myers Junior at the

62
00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:04.000
University of Minnesota calls the Minnesota Paradox. Minnesota is one

63
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.500
